#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Mga kinakailangan {#requirements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "QRMI supports the following operating systems (OS): \n"
msgstr "Sinusuportahan ng QRMI ang mga sumusunod na operating system (OS):\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Compiling environment {#compiling-environment}"
msgstr "Compiling environment {#compiling-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '*  '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) 1.91 or above\n"
msgstr ""
"[Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) 1.91 o mas mataas\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A C compiler: for example, GCC (`gcc`) on Linux and Clang (`clang-tools-"
"extra`) for Rust unknown targets/cross compilations. QRMI is compatible with"
" a compiler conforming to the C11 standard\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang C compiler: halimbawa, GCC (`gcc`) sa Linux at Clang (`clang-tools-"
"extra`) para sa mga Rust unknown target/cross compilation. Ang QRMI ay "
"compatible sa isang compiler na sumusunod sa C11 standard\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`make/cmake` (make/cmake RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "`make/cmake` (make/cmake RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`openssl` (openssl-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "`openssl` (openssl-devel RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`zlib` (zlib-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "`zlib` (zlib-devel RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.11, 3.12, or 3.13 (For Python API)\n"
msgstr "Python 3.11, 3.12, o 3.13 (Para sa Python API)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Libraries and header files needed for Python development (python3.1x-devel "
"RPM for RHEL-compatible OS):\n"
msgstr ""
"Mga library at header file na kailangan para sa Python development "
"(python3.1x-devel RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/include/python3.1x\n"
msgstr "/usr/include/python3.1x\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/lib64/libpython3.1x.so\n"
msgstr "/usr/lib64/libpython3.1x.so\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Doxygen (for generating C API documentation), depending on the OS:\n"
msgstr "Doxygen (para sa paglikha ng C API documentation), depende sa OS:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```dnf install doxygen``` for Linux (RHEL/CentOS/Rocky Linux and others)\n"
msgstr ""
"```dnf install doxygen``` para sa Linux (RHEL/CentOS/Rocky Linux at iba "
"pa)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "```apt install doxygen``` for Linux (Ubuntu and others)\n"
msgstr "```apt install doxygen``` para sa Linux (Ubuntu at iba pa)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "```brew install doxygen```for MacOS\n"
msgstr "```brew install doxygen```para sa MacOS\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Runtime environment {#runtime-environment}"
msgstr "Runtime environment {#runtime-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "gcc (libgcc RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "gcc (libgcc RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "openssl (openssl-libs RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "openssl (openssl-libs RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "zlib (zlib RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "zlib (zlib RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Libraries and header files needed for Python development (python3.1x-devel "
"RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr ""
"Mga library at header file na kailangan para sa Python development "
"(python3.1x-devel RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build the Rust/C API library with the following commands wherever you have "
"saved the QRMI repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-build ang Rust/C API library gamit ang mga sumusunod na command saan man "
"nai-save ang QRMI repository.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To build the Python package, first set up a Python environment and install "
"the required dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para i-build ang Python package, i-set up muna ang isang Python environment "
"at i-install ang mga kinakailangang dependency.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create the stub files for the Python code.\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng mga stub file para sa Python code.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Lastly, build the Python wheels for distribution to your hosts.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panghuli, i-build ang mga Python wheel para sa pamamahagi sa iyong mga "
"host.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The wheel is created in the `./target/release/maturin/wheels` directory. You"
" can distribute and install on your hosts by `pip install <wheel>`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang wheel ay nililikha sa direktoryo na `./target/release/maturin/wheels`. "
"Maaari mo itong ipamahagi at i-install sa iyong mga host gamit ang `pip "
"install <wheel>`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Logging {#logging}"
msgstr "Logging {#logging}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"QRMI supports [log crate](https://crates.io/crates/log) for logging. You can"
" find the detailed QRMI runtime logs by specifying `RUST_LOG` environment "
"variable with the log level. Supported levels are `error`, `warn`, `info`, "
"`debug`, and `trace`. The default level is `warn`. \n"
msgstr ""
"Sinusuportahan ng QRMI ang [log crate](https://crates.io/crates/log) para sa"
" logging. Mahahanap mo ang mga detalyadong QRMI runtime log sa pamamagitan "
"ng pagtukoy ng `RUST_LOG` environment variable kasama ang log level. Ang mga"
" sinusuportahang level ay `error`, `warn`, `info`, `debug`, at `trace`. Ang "
"default na level ay `warn`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If you specify `trace`, you can find underlying HTTP transaction logs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung tutukuyin mo ang `trace`, mahahanap mo ang mga pinagbabatayang HTTP "
"transaction log.\n"

